  "method": "GSE325982 re-run on 2026-09-23 with every tool on Cell Ranger's default probe policy, the included probes only: Cell Ranger 9.0.1 with filter-probes true, STAR-Flex exporting the included-probe gene set (18,129 genes) and cyto 0.4.7 with the included-probe gene table. STAR-Flex from the original plain-gzip FASTQ through rapidgzip and from CBQ; cyto from gzip FASTQ and CBQ; Cell Ranger from FASTQ, no BAM, no secondary analysis, 32 cores. One run per arm on each of three hosts (local workstation, cloud NVMe m6id, cloud HDD h1), each on a quiet host with a cold page cache and all loci checked. Wall time is whole-process GNU time; disk is the peak growth above the pre-run baseline sampled every 5 s. Concordance is computed with the same script as the other Flex datasets, pooled over the four single-tag samples with a cell identified by barcode and tag.",
